al 10th–90th percentile of current listings; median is the mid-point. Outliers excluded.\n\n## 📊 Property rates in Worli\n\nApartments — buy**₹70,000–165,000/sqft**\n\n1 BHK — rent**₹65,000–1.65 Lac/mo**\n\n2 BHK — rent**₹1.65 Lac–3.3 Lac/mo**\n\n3 BHK — rent**₹3.3 Lac–7.7 Lac/mo**\n\nCommercial — lease**₹200–990/sqft**\n\n[See all Mumbai property rates →](/property-rates-in-mumbai)\n\nUpdated May 2026 · Real Estate Mumbai research\n\n## 📰 News about Worli\n\n* [Worli Leads Mumbai Luxury Housing With ₹2,272 Crore Sales24 Aug 2026](/news/worli-leads-mumbai-luxury-housing-with-2-272-crore-sales/1853)\n* [10 Mumbai Luxury Projects Record ₹3,815 Crore in Home Sales24 Aug 2026](/news/10-mumbai-luxury-projects-record-3-815-crore-in-home-sales/1851)\n* [Mumbai ₹10 Crore Plus Home Sales Hit ₹18,512 Crore31 Jul 2026](/news/mumbai-10-crore-plus-home-sales-hit-18-512-crore/1651)\n* [Mumbai Home Sales Reach ₹18,512 Crore31 Jul 2026](/news/mumbai-home-sales-reach-18-512-crore/1652)\n\n About flats for rent in Worli\n\nWorli is one of Mumbai's most prestigious residential and commercial addresses, dramatically transformed over the past two decades from an industrial zone to a skyline of luxury high-rises. The Bandra-Worli Sea Link — one of India's engineering marvels — connects Worli to Bandra in under 10 minutes, making it the ideal address for professionals working across the city. The Sea Link views from premium towers here are among the finest in all of Mumbai.\n\nBeyond the views, Worli offers proximity to the Nehru Centre, Worli Fort, and the Haji Ali Dargah. The upcoming Metro Line 3 station at Worli will add a new dimension of connectivity. The neighbourhood is home to major corporate headquarters, five-star hotels, and some of Mumbai's best fine-dining restaurants along the Worli Sea Face promenade.\n\nResidential properties in Worli span luxury 2 to 5 BHK apartments and ultra-premium penthouses, with some of Mumbai's highest per-sqft rates. Key developers active here include Lodha, Raheja, Piramal, and Oberoi. The area attracts senior corporate executives, NRIs, and HNI investors. Real Estate Mumbai has deep expertise in the Worli market, with listings across all price segments and decades of transaction history.\n\n## Frequently asked questions in Worli\n\n How many flats for rent are available in Worli?\n\nThere are 801 verified flats for rent in Worli on Real Estate Mumbai, updated daily with real photos, carpet area, prices and RERA details.\n\n  What is the monthly rent for a 2 BHK in Worli?\n\nA 2 BHK flat in Worli typically rents for Rs. 165,000 to Rs. 330,000 per month, depending on furnishing, floor and the building.\n\n  Is Worli a good area to rent a flat in Mumbai?\n\nWorli is an established Mumbai locality with 801 verified flats for rent currently available. Browse real photos and connect directly on WhatsApp with Real Estate Mumbai, trusted since 1995.\n\n## Mumbai Property News\n\n[All news →](/property-news)\n\n[![BMC to Map Sea-Level Risk Across Mumbai's 149-km Coastline](/thumb/480/news/9f7a1e2af6b3.png)\n\nBMC to Map Sea-Level Risk Across Mumbai's 149-km Coastline\n\n07 Sep 2026](/news/bmc-to-map-sea-level-risk-across-mumbais-149-km-coastline/10001932) [![8 Years After Possession, MahaRERA Orders Repairs at Crescent Bay Parel](/thumb/480/news/295015af44af.png)\n\n8 Years After Possession, MahaRERA Orders Repairs at Crescent Bay Parel\n\n07 Sep 2026](/news/8-years-after-possession-maharera-orders-repairs-at-crescent-bay-parel/10001929) [![Maharashtra Property Sale Deeds to Get GIS Maps From October](/thumb/480/news/1d1b905aaf03.png)\n\nMaharashtra Property Sale Deeds to Get GIS Maps From October\n\n05 Sep 2026](/news/maharashtra-property-sale-deeds-to-get-gis-maps-from-october/10001926) [![48-Acre Chunabhatti Mill Land Set for Development After HC Ruling](/thumb/480/news/9a8058c6489a.jpg)\n\n48-Acre Chunabhatti Mill Land Set for Development After HC Ruling\n\n04 Sep 2026](/news/48-acre-chunabhatti-mill-land-set-